const cats=[['法律法规知识','⚖️'],['应急救援基础知识','🧭'],['应急装备知识','🧰']];let mode='chapter',pool=[],idx=0,selected=null,submitted=false,filterCat='全部';let answers=Object.assign({},DEFAULT_ANSWERS,JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('er_answers')||'{}')),records=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('er_records')||'{}'),wrong=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('er_wrong')||'[]');const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);function save(){localStorage.setItem('er_answers',JSON.stringify(answers));localStorage.setItem('er_records',JSON.stringify(records));localStorage.setItem('er_wrong',JSON.stringify(wrong));refreshStats()}function refreshStats(){let done=Object.keys(records).length,master=Object.values(records).filter(x=>x==='right').length;$('done').textContent=done;$('rate').textContent=done?Math.round(master/done*100)+'%':'—';$('total').textContent=QUESTIONS.length}function init(){ $('cats').innerHTML=cats.map(([c,ic])=>`<button class="cat" onclick="startChapter('${c}')"><span class="ico">${ic}</span><span><b>${c}</b><small>${QUESTIONS.filter(q=>q.category===c).length} 道题 · 单选与判断</small></span><span class="arrow">›</span></button>`).join('');refreshStats()}function hideViews(){['home','practice','result'].forEach(x=>$(x).classList.add('hidden'))}function goHome(){hideViews();$('home').classList.remove('hidden')}function startChapter(c){mode='chapter';filterCat=c;pool=QUESTIONS.filter(q=>q.category===c);begin()}function startMode(m){mode=m;filterCat='全部';if(m==='wrong')pool=QUESTIONS.filter(q=>wrong.includes(q.id));else if(m==='exam')pool=shuffle([...QUESTIONS]).slice(0,50);else pool=shuffle([...QUESTIONS]).slice(0,30);if(!pool.length){alert('当前没有可练习的错题');return}begin()}function shuffle(a){for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){let j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]]}return a}function begin(){idx=0;selected=null;submitted=false;hideViews();$('practice').classList.remove('hidden');$('filters').innerHTML=mode==='chapter'?'<button class="chip active" onclick="setType(\'全部\',this)">全部</button><button class="chip" onclick="setType(\'单选题\',this)">单选题</button><button class="chip" onclick="setType(\'判断题\',this)">判断题</button>':'';render()}function setType(t,el){let c=filterCat;pool=QUESTIONS.filter(q=>q.category===c&&(t==='全部'||q.type===t));idx=0;document.querySelectorAll('#filters .chip').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));el.classList.add('active');render()}function render(){if(idx>=pool.length){finish();return}let q=pool[idx];selected=null;submitted=false;$('progress').textContent=`${idx+1} / ${pool.length}`;$('progressbar').style.width=((idx+1)/pool.length*100)+'%';$('qmeta').textContent=q.category+' · '+q.type;$('qnum').textContent='第 '+q.number+' 题';$('stem').textContent=q.stem;$('options').innerHTML=q.options.map(o=>`<button class="opt" data-key="${o.key}" onclick="choose('${o.key}')"><span class="letter">${o.key}</span><span>${escapeHtml(o.text)}</span></button>`).join('');$('feedback').innerHTML='';$('answerActions').innerHTML='';}function choose(k){if(submitted)return;selected=k;document.querySelectorAll('.opt').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.key===k));$('answerActions').innerHTML='<button class="btn" onclick="submitAnswer()">确认答案</button>'}function submitAnswer(){if(!selected){alert('请先选择答案');return}let q=pool[idx],key=answers[q.id];submitted=true;let known=!!key,correct=known&&selected===key;document.querySelectorAll('.opt').forEach(b=>{if(known&&b.dataset.key===key)b.classList.add('correct');if(known&&b.dataset.key===selected&&!correct)b.classList.add('wrong')});if(known){records[q.id]=correct?'right':'wrong';if(correct)wrong=wrong.filter(x=>x!==q.id);else if(!wrong.includes(q.id))wrong.push(q.id);$('feedback').innerHTML=`<div class="feedback">${correct?'回答正确！':'回答错误。'} 标准答案：<b>${key}</b>${EXPLANATIONS[q.id]?'<br><br>参考说明：'+escapeHtml(EXPLANATIONS[q.id]):''}</div>`;$('answerActions').innerHTML='<button class="btn secondary" onclick="nextQ()">继续</button>'}else{$('feedback').innerHTML='<div class="feedback">这道题尚未录入标准答案。请对照正式答案册核对后进行自评。</div>';$('answerActions').innerHTML='<button class="btn green" onclick="selfRate(true)">我答对了</button><button class="btn red" onclick="selfRate(false)">我答错了</button>'}}function selfRate(ok){let q=pool[idx];records[q.id]=ok?'right':'wrong';if(ok)wrong=wrong.filter(x=>x!==q.id);else if(!wrong.includes(q.id))wrong.push(q.id);save();$('feedback').innerHTML=`<div class="feedback">已记录：${ok?'自评答对':'自评答错'}。可在错题本中复习。</div>`;$('answerActions').innerHTML='<button class="btn secondary" onclick="nextQ()">继续</button>'}function nextQ(){idx++;render()}function prevQ(){if(idx>0){idx--;render()}}function finish(){hideViews();$('result').classList.remove('hidden');let graded=pool.filter(q=>answers[q.id]).length,correct=pool.filter(q=>answers[q.id]&&records[q.id]==='right').length;$('result').innerHTML=`<div class="panel"><h2>本次练习完成</h2><p>完成题数：${pool.length}</p><p>已配置标准答案：${graded} 道</p><p>自动判分正确：${correct} 道</p><p class="small">未配置标准答案的题目按自评记录，不计入自动判分成绩。</p><button class="btn" onclick="goHome()">返回首页</button></div>`}function showPanel(which){let html='';if(which==='keys'){html=`<h3>标准答案管理</h3><p class="small">按题目编号搜索，输入 A/B/C/D 或 Y/N。答案仅保存在当前设备浏览器中。请以正式答案册核实后录入。</p><input class="input" id="keySearch" placeholder="输入题号或题干关键词" oninput="filterKeys()"><div id="keyList"></div><div class="btnrow"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="closePanel()">关闭</button><button class="btn" onclick="exportKeys()">导出答案表</button></div>`}else if(which==='wronglist'){html=`<h3>错题本（${wrong.length}）</h3><div>${wrong.length?wrong.map(id=>{let q=QUESTIONS.find(x=>x.id===id);return `<div class="listitem"><b>${q.category} · ${q.type} 第${q.number}题</b><br>${escapeHtml(q.stem)}</div>`}).join(''):'暂无错题'}</div><div class="btnrow"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="closePanel()">关闭</button><button class="btn" onclick="startMode('wrong')">开始重练</button></div>`}else{html=`<h3>学习统计</h3><p>题库：${QUESTIONS.length} 题</p><p>已练习：${Object.keys(records).length} 题</p><p>自评/自动判对：${Object.values(records).filter(x=>x==='right').length} 题</p><p>错题：${wrong.length} 题</p><p>已录入标准答案：${Object.keys(answers).length} 题</p><div class="btnrow"><button class="btn" onclick="closePanel()">关闭</button></div>`}$('modal').innerHTML=`<div class="modal" onclick="if(event.target===this)closePanel()"><div class="sheet">${html}</div></div>`;$('modal').classList.remove('hidden');if(which==='keys')filterKeys()}function filterKeys(){let term=($('keySearch')?.value||'').trim().toLowerCase();let arr=QUESTIONS.filter(q=>!term||q.id.toLowerCase().includes(term)||q.stem.toLowerCase().includes(term)).slice(0,80);$('keyList').innerHTML=arr.map(q=>`<div class="listitem"><b>${q.category} · ${q.type} 第${q.number}题</b><br>${escapeHtml(q.stem)}<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:7px"><input class="input" style="max-width:100px" id="ans-${safeId(q.id)}" value="${answers[q.id]||''}" placeholder="A/B/C/D 或 Y/N"><button class="chip" onclick="saveKey('${q.id}')">保存</button></div></div>`).join('')+(arr.length===80?'<p class="small">仅显示前80条，请缩小搜索范围。</p>':'')}function safeId(s){return s.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g,'_')}function saveKey(id){let q=QUESTIONS.find(x=>x.id===id),v=$('ans-'+safeId(id)).value.trim().toUpperCase();let allowed=q.type==='判断题'?['Y','N']:q.options.map(x=>x.key);if(v&&!allowed.includes(v)){alert('答案格式不正确：'+allowed.join('/'));return}if(v)answers[id]=v;else delete answers[id];save();alert('已保存')}function exportKeys(){let blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(answers,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download='应急救援题库答案表.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}function closePanel(){$('modal').classList.add('hidden')}function escapeHtml(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]))}init();
</script></body></html>
